  "atmosphere_and_mood": "Eruptive theatrical joy. Deafening audience cheers. Sudden, brutal heartbreak. Ominous corporate synergy disguised as genuine cinematic love.",
  "themes_and_messages": "With great power comes great sacrifice. Fixing past mistakes. The curse of being remembered. Radical empathy for villains over mere destruction.",
  "character_relationships": "Pete, MJ, and Ned against an uncaring world. Generational Spider-brothers bonding over shared grief. A mentor's fatal lesson. Unrelenting, chaotic malice from the Green Goblin.",
